WEBVTT

00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:16,940
I'm finding that on one of my longer nights of my life treatment, I have to interrupt my last hour.

00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:23,100
So I assume you're waking up and you're like, oh, I'm going to get up and get going here,

00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:28,540
and there's still an hour left in my program. What is the acceptable amount of time to put

00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:36,540
on pause before returning back to it? I mean, if you are getting up on one of the nights and

00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:41,980
pausing it and coming back to it, there's no harm in doing that no matter what the time is.

00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:50,940
But do you have to? No, you don't have to. Remember, there's frequencies in it that are

00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:56,060
constantly recycling. That's how I write the programs because you really shouldn't be

00:00:56,060 --> 00:01:06,220
running frequencies more than three minutes, 180 seconds at any given time with some exceptions.

00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:13,820
You go up to six minutes or so, but you so they have to recycle. So you add up how many

00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:19,980
frequencies can you run in an eight hour program or running several hundred frequencies, but even

00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:25,980
several hundred frequencies, they're recycling. Otherwise, we would only have a four hour program.

00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:35,020
So you're getting those again. So if you are, if somebody's got, let's say, eight and a half hour

00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:43,260
programs and they ask me, well, I only literally, only sleep five and a half hours every day. I have to go

00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:49,820
to I, you know, I've had a trucker that did that. He has to go to work. He's only weeks, five and a half

00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:56,540
hours. So and I shortened his program. But by all means, if you're if you're missing an hour or

00:01:56,540 --> 00:02:04,380
an hour and a half, every, every couple, every few days or a few of the programs and you know,

00:02:04,380 --> 00:02:09,660
that's fine. So you're you're doing fine. And if you are pausing it, coming back to it,

00:02:09,660 --> 00:02:11,420
then you're not missing anything. So

